284 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 115 0 R
/T (Users hitting the 1OD-15D threshold or demonstrating both velocity signals are tagged as "Power User Seeds." Instead of broad targeting, we continuously narrow our Top-of-Funnel \(TOFU\) campaigns to target Lookalike audiences based strictly on this newly identified, high-intent cohort. We will also be feeding these device IDs back into Meta and Google as custom events via server-to-server APIs, aligned with the defined Power User criteria.)
/E (Users hitting the 1OD-15D threshold or demonstrating both velocity signals are tagged as "Power User Seeds." Instead of broad targeting, we continuously narrow our Top-of-Funnel \(TOFU\) campaigns to target Lookalike audiences based strictly on this newly identified, high-intent cohort. We will also be feeding these device IDs back into Meta and Google as custom events via server-to-server APIs, aligned with the defined Power User criteria.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
285 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 115 0 R
/T (Our Day 0 to Day 7 activation flow systematically nudges users from exploration to locked-in habits based on real-time behavioral signals. On Day 0, we target high-curiosity "Explorers" who browse broadly but hesitate to buy by deploying a 30-minute time-bombed push notification featuring a Hero SKU and free delivery to force that crucial first transaction. If a user exhibits high intent but abandons their cart between Days 1 and 3 due to price sensitivity, we intervene with a targeted bundle up-sell via WhatsApp or in-app prompts, clearing checkout friction while protecting our Average Order Value \(AOV\). Finally, once a user places their second order by Day 7, they are flagged as a high-value Power User. From then only, shift focus on those users retention.)
/E (Our Day 0 to Day 7 activation flow systematically nudges users from exploration to locked-in habits based on real-time behavioral signals. On Day 0, we target high-curiosity "Explorers" who browse broadly but hesitate to buy by deploying a 30-minute time-bombed push notification featuring a Hero SKU and free delivery to force that crucial first transaction. If a user exhibits high intent but abandons their cart between Days 1 and 3 due to price sensitivity, we intervene with a targeted bundle up-sell via WhatsApp or in-app prompts, clearing checkout friction while protecting our Average Order Value \(AOV\). Finally, once a user places their second order by Day 7, they are flagged as a high-value Power User. From then only, shift focus on those users retention.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
