610 0 obj
<<
/Title (Our Day 0 to Day 7 activation flow systematically nudges users from exploration to locked-in habits based on real-time behavioral signals. On Day 0, we target high-curiosity "Explorers" who browse broadly but hesitate to buy by deploying a 30-minute time-bombed push notification featuring a Hero SKU and free delivery to force that crucial first transaction. If a user exhibits high intent but abandons their cart between Days 1 and 3 due to price sensitivity, we intervene with a targeted bundle up-sell via WhatsApp or in-app prompts, clearing checkout friction while protecting our Average Order Value \(AOV\). Finally, once a user places their second order by Day 7, they are flagged as a high-value Power User. From then only, shift focus on those users retention.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 16 0 R
/Prev 687 0 R
/Next 305 0 R
>>
endobj
