/Title (Users hitting the 1OD-15D threshold or demonstrating both velocity signals are tagged as "Power User Seeds." Instead of broad targeting, we continuously narrow our Top-of-Funnel \(TOFU\) campaigns to target Lookalike audiences based strictly on this newly identified, high-intent cohort. We will also be feeding these device IDs back into Meta and Google as custom events via server-to-server APIs, aligned with the defined Power User criteria.)
